Description: Vajra OS Default Wallpapers
 Default tricolor diamond wallpaper pack for the Vajra OS desktop.
 Ships the generated Vajra diamond wallpaper (1920x1080) as
 /usr/share/backgrounds/vajra/vajra-default.png.
